# covers: vanilla k8s, EKS, AKS, GKE, OKE, ACK, OpenShift (auto-detected)
# usage:
#   cis-k8s.py                     detect provider, run everything possible
#   cis-k8s.py --install           download kubectl/kube-bench if missing
